  "status": "hand",
  "note": "Every registry name in the mynaui registry is a variant of a group page (name <group><n> or kebab-joined <group> + n, e.g. appheaders1 -> /components/app-headers, bloglist3 -> /components/blog-list); the rewrite maps each name to its group slug taken from the registry's own docs urls, so a click lands on the page showing that variant. 346 items -> 69 pages. Nothing is left url-less in the config; pages that 404 are misses. 4041..4045 -> /components/404."
